  title="Agent Hijacking: The Security Risk Most Enterprises Can't Even Detect, KYDE"
  description="OWASP ranks Agent Goal Hijacking as the #1 risk facing autonomous AI agents. 48% of security professionals identify agentic AI as the top attack vector for 2026. Yet most enterprises have no controls, and no forensic infrastructure to detect or investigate an incident."
>
  <Navbar />

  <main>

    <!-- ══════════ HEADER ══════════ -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="bg-grid absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-36 pb-16 md:pt-48 md:pb-20 md:border-x md:border-line-0">

