              <div class="space-y-4">
                <a href="/blog/compromised-agent-no-logs" class="group flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-ink-1 hover:text-ink-1 transition-colors leading-relaxed">
                  <span class="font-mono text-warn shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform">→</span>
                  <span>What Happens When an AI Agent Gets Compromised, And Nobody Has the Logs</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/blog/shadow-ai-production-systems" class="group flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-ink-1 hover:text-ink-1 transition-colors leading-relaxed">
                  <span class="font-mono text-warn shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform">→</span>
                  <span>Shadow AI Is Already in Your Production Systems</span>
